per, The Mental Elevator, in both Seneca and English (Pilling1888:175-178). Wright went to the Buffalo Creek reservationas a missionary in 1831 and spent the next 15 years there. When this reservation was sold, he and his wife moved to Cattaraugus where Wright died.\'  We have assumed 1831 as a provisional date of transition.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 1916, 'temperature': 0.2})
